              <ipxact:name>dlpulse_alignment</ipxact:name>
              <ipxact:description>&lt;b&gt;DL Pulse Alignment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;When 1, indicates that the start of the DL Pulse (am_valid) arrived on word_align=1.  When 0, DL Pulse started on word_align=0.&lt;/p&gt;</ipxact:description>
              <ipxact:bitOffset>7</ipxact:bitOffset>
